[(You can trade off cutoff frequency with foldover. Here, the)]
[(filter is set for a cutoff of 15 kHz. Lowering it to 7500 Hz)]
[(would further reduce foldover by 18 dB at the expense of)]
[(losing energy in the range 7500-15000 Hz.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
