0 54 554 [
[(The [pd 16x] subpatch at left contains a [phasor~] object,)]
[(but is locally upsampled by a factor of sixteen. Without)]
[(upsampling, partials as low as 24 kHz fold back over into)]
[(the audible range. With upsampling, the first audibly)]
[(folding over partial is at almost 700 Hz, 29 times higher.)]
[(The relevant partials will be 29 times, or almost 30 dB,)]
[(quieter when upsampled.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 59 137 [
[(A third-order Butterworth filter is used inside the [pd 16x])]
[(subpatch - without that, the internal signal would fold over)]
[(as it gets downsampled at the [outlet~] object.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
